Effect aliases require their row arguments
effectname E(e::Eff) = {Ask:Int|e}; sig f : () -E-> Int fun f() { do Ask }
stderr : @.*Arity mismatch: Type E expects 1 type arguments, but 0 arguments were provided.*
exit : 1

An effect alias cannot use an anonymous tail
effectname E = {Ask:Int|_};
stderr : @.*Unbound anonymous type variable.*
exit : 1
